    {
     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p3-information-block",
     "replacement": "- $x>3$ means “$x$ is greater than 3.”\n- We show inequalities on a number line using:\n  - Arrows pointing right for larger values.\n  - Arrows pointing left for smaller values.\n  - An **open circle** ($\\circ$) for “less than” ($<$) or “greater than” ($>$).\n  - A **closed circle** ($\\bullet$) for “less than or equal to” ($\\le$) or “greater than or equal to” ($\\ge$).\n\n**Less than** $x<a$ [tikz]\n% mathsmap-inline-width-mm 35\n% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"rayRed\",\"hex\":\"EF6068\",\"reason\":\"inequality solution ray and endpoint\"}],\"reference\":\"page 3 p3-less-than\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{rayRed}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\draw[<->,black,line width=0.5pt] (-3,0)--(3,0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (0,0)--(0,-0.12);\n\\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {\\$a\\$};\n\\draw[->,rayRed,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(-2.1,0);\n\\draw[rayRed,fill=white,line width=0.8pt] (0,0) circle[radius=1mm];\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n[/tikz]\t**More than** $x>a$ [tikz]\n% mathsmap-inline-width-mm 35\n% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"rayRed\",\"hex\":\"EF6068\",\"reason\":\"inequality solution ray and endpoint\"}],\"reference\":\"page 3 p3-more-than\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{rayRed}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\draw[<->,black,line width=0.5pt] (-3,0)--(3,0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (0,0)--(0,-0.12);\n\\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {\\$a\\$};\n\\draw[->,rayRed,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(2.1,0);\n\\draw[rayRed,fill=white,line width=0.8pt] (0,0) circle[radius=1mm];\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n[/tikz]\n**Less than or equal to** $x\\le a$ [tikz]\n% mathsmap-inline-width-mm 35\n% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"rayRed\",\"hex\":\"EF6068\",\"reason\":\"inequality solution ray and included endpoint\"}],\"reference\":\"page 3 p3-less-than-equal\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{rayRed}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\draw[<->,black,line width=0.5pt] (-3,0)--(3,0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (0,0)--(0,-0.12);\n\\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {\\$a\\$};\n\\draw[->,rayRed,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(-2.1,0);\n\\fill[rayRed] (0,0) circle[radius=1mm];\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n[/tikz]\t**More than or equal to** $x\\ge a$ [tikz]\n% mathsmap-inline-width-mm 35\n% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"rayRed\",\"hex\":\"EF6068\",\"reason\":\"inequality solution ray and included endpoint\"}],\"reference\":\"page 3 p3-more-than-equal\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=10mm,y=10mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{rayRed}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\draw[<->,black,line width=0.5pt] (-3,0)--(3,0);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (0,0)--(0,-0.12);\n\\node[below] at (0,-0.12) {\\$a\\$};\n\\draw[->,rayRed,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(2.1,0);\n\\fill[rayRed] (0,0) circle[radius=1mm];\n\\end{tikzpicture}\n[/tikz]\n\nWhen two conditions are joined, the solutions are the values that satisfy both.",
